{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "73a2c635-be4e-542d-96ae-b34d5b6584d3", "source_ordinal": 825, "reading_ordinal": 3232, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "正确的困难", "published_at": "2025-04-25T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/85fe9eca1bb911f0a0cc5254001e7c00"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "什么叫“正确的困难”？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这是指有某种严谨的自然法则、数学论证可以做出可信证明的、无法进一步用巧妙的方法绕过的、具有普遍性的、一旦找到克服方法就会产生价值的困难。", "char_start": 12, "char_end": 80}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "它不是虚假的困难——即不具备任何普遍性的、可以轻易绕行的困难；", "char_start": 81, "char_end": 112}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "也不是错误的困难——即克服后并不产生价值的困难。", "char_start": 113, "char_end": 137}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "它一旦发生就没法绕过，一旦克服就能产生重要的借鉴意义、公共价值。", "char_start": 138, "char_end": 170}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "举点例子——例如你自己不幸骨折了，这事一发生，你就绕不过去了。", "char_start": 171, "char_end": 202}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "它也有相当的普遍性——骨折的人很多。", "char_start": 203, "char_end": 221}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "而克服它——例如通过自己的摸索、研究，探索出某种骨折患者的疗养经验、求医经验——就能产生很大的公共利益。", "char_start": 222, "char_end": 274}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "然后举点反面的例子——例如你跑去犯罪，然后被追捕逼得走投无路，你这个困难就是错误的困难——它不但可以靠不犯罪轻易的绕过，而且真的克服了也不产生公众价值。", "char_start": 275, "char_end": 351}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "而比如你抑郁了、你失恋了、你失业了、你的孩子厌学了……一旦发生你就无法绕过，落到你头上了你必须面对，而这时你如果解决成功就能对千千万万人有启发意义、激励效果。", "char_start": 353, "char_end": 432}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "那么你就可以把你的这个遭遇看作一种正确的困难。", "char_start": 433, "char_end": 456}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "你要意识到，你和这些困难对抗的过程有足以在将来决定其ta后来人生死的价值，你不仅仅是在为了你自己挣扎、努力，而且你挣扎、努力成功，你所获得的也不仅仅是“我可以回到困境前”而已。", "char_start": 457, "char_end": 545}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "很多人之所以撑不过自己遇到的困难，就是因为满脑子只想着“就算我腿好了，也会耽误两年的芭蕾练习”“就算我从抑郁中恢复，也要面对荒废了两年的残缺人生”，觉得就算努力成功，成功的奖品也没有足够的价值。", "char_start": 546, "char_end": 643}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "所以ta们与自身困难战斗的体验才沮丧不堪、充满无尽的折磨，以至于常常通向彻底放弃。", "char_start": 644, "char_end": 685}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "一旦人能意识到自己如果努力成功，也许在“芭蕾舞生涯”“事业发展”上的确会有无法挽回的残缺，但在“如何克服、战胜这类困难”上获得对其他人宝贵的、权威的经验借鉴甚至方法指引，以至于后者的价值足以弥补那“几年的荒废”还有余，人与困难战斗的体验就会发生巨大的变化。", "char_start": 686, "char_end": 814}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "“一定是上天发现我特牛x，所以特别分派这个课题给我，让我替全人类开路”。", "char_start": 815, "char_end": 851}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你能带着这个心态来与你的困难战斗，你就会发现这越到后来越成为一种享受。", "char_start": 852, "char_end": 887}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "你反而会因为对困难理解得不够深、可能过度自我麻醉，导致你摸索的解决方案不彻底而遗憾。", "char_start": 888, "char_end": 930}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "将来你会明白的——其实“克服过这些困难”反而恰恰是你最大的人生财富，若非这粒沙落进你的蚌壳里面，你还结不了这么大的珍珠。", "char_start": 931, "char_end": 991}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "那不但不是诅咒，反而是一种赐福。", "char_start": 992, "char_end": 1008}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "一旦你摆正了这个心态，“困难”就像那些特别难通关的游戏，在挫折吃力之外，自有一份成就感和享受。", "char_start": 1009, "char_end": 1056}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "另一个问题是——如果这困难太大怎么办？如果它克服不了呢？", "char_start": 1057, "char_end": 1085}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "第一，坚定的信仰者永远不会对运气绝望。", "char_start": 1086, "char_end": 1105}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "我永远不会断言“不可能再有好运了”，这甚至和我自己是不是行善积德、无愧天地无关——即使是恶人、罪人，也不必断言自己绝无好运了。", "char_start": 1106, "char_end": 1169}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "因此只要是正确的困难，我就坚信自有天佑。我自己或许能力不足，但有天佑就没有所谓的能力不足。", "char_start": 1170, "char_end": 1215}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "只管努力，不必多做忧虑，你所不及的，自有运气负责。", "char_start": 1216, "char_end": 1241}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "第二，即使真的没有幸存，能做到没有以恶为业本身就是成功。", "char_start": 1243, "char_end": 1271}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "人生自古谁无死？但我至死没有拉别人挡枪、没有出卖同志、没有嫁祸于人，这是尊严绝命。", "char_start": 1272, "char_end": 1313}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "这是一种成功，而不是一种失败。", "char_start": 1314, "char_end": 1329}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "所以，在正确的困难面前，根本无所谓失败。", "char_start": 1331, "char_end": 1351}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "它是有折磨，但谁说有折磨就没有享乐？", "char_start": 1352, "char_end": 1370}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "放下顾虑，安然享受吧。", "char_start": 1371, "char_end": 1382}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 36}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0466"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何最深最好的享受正确的困难？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032"], "summary": "围绕“正确的困难”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“什么叫“正确的困难”？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "什么叫“正确的困难”？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "962867fe-554a-5869-a70b-d9720c46629a", "source_ordinal": 824, "reading_ordinal": 3233, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "沉默的大多数", "published_at": "2025-04-25T07:01:15.438000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1896471445078513169/answer/1898994711101940299"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "早就说过了——沉默的大多数不是沉默的站在你那边，而是站在法律那边。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 33}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "中国是世界上公认治理最成功的国家，近四十年是人类历史上空前的经济奇迹，这两个最大的基本事实基本保证了“沉默者将站在官方一方”这种基本态势。", "char_start": 34, "char_end": 103}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这是个你必须认清的朴素的事实。", "char_start": 104, "char_end": 119}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "如果你认定“沉默的人一定都像我和我的茧房同志一样敢怒不敢言”，然后极力想要“发动群众”，那么你会发现两个结果——要么你动静小，因为真正的大多数懒得参与而你的同圈层这点热情又有限，你会发现热度迅速褪去；要么你同圈层的热情似火，长期延续这个话题热度，以至于真的导致沉默的大多数觉的受到了打扰甚至觉得威胁到了ta们现在足够满意的生活，那么接下来不但不会是你期待的万众响应，反而会是潮水般地路人的反驳。", "char_start": 120, "char_end": 317}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "因为长期热度不散，你真的威胁到大家的生活了。", "char_start": 318, "char_end": 340}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "而这个生活，你不满意，老百姓是满意的。", "char_start": 341, "char_end": 360}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "大多数老百姓认为这个判案标准可以保护自己、母亲、姐妹、妻子和女儿——ta们人人都有女眷。", "char_start": 361, "char_end": 405}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "大多数人不担心自己、父亲、兄弟、儿子在求欢的时候搞出什么拖拽录像、浑身青紫、反锁屋内、火烧窗帘。ta们不恐惧“万一搞出这些会被判强奸”这种风险。", "char_start": 406, "char_end": 478}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "就像ta们不恐惧徒手攀岩可能摔死、无氧攀登喜马拉雅容易窒息死一样。", "char_start": 479, "char_end": 512}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "而且ta们厌恶你为了你自己那点小心思，打着争取ta们根本不稀罕的“权利”的旗号，去增加ta们所不想要的风险。", "char_start": 513, "char_end": 567}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "就这么朴素。", "char_start": 568, "char_end": 574}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "想要掀起社会变革，这是每个公民的权利，但是如果你连这点基本的常识都没有，或者故意自欺欺人、佯装不知，你遭遇失败一点都不冤。", "char_start": 575, "char_end": 636}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "真的遭遇了，你还要拿什么“这都是敌人有组织的反扑”来解释，你会在根本错误的“革命事业”上不断的追加赌注，越走越黑，直到彻底破产。", "char_start": 637, "char_end": 701}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "收手吧，阿祖。", "char_start": 702, "char_end": 709}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "是你错了。", "char_start": 710, "char_end": 715}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 15}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0466"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么网上突然多了支持大同订婚强奸案二审维持原判的博主？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015"], "summary": "围绕“沉默的大多数”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“早就说过了——沉默的大多数不是沉默的站在你那边，而是站在法律那边。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "早就说过了——沉默的大多数不是沉默的站在你那边，而是站在法律那边。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 33, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "62ec394c-8e7d-5f83-b8ba-30b7e618d69d", "source_ordinal": 823, "reading_ordinal": 3234, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "优先级算法", "published_at": "2025-04-26T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/be1b06761c8211f0a3ac52540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "按照“不满足该需求的后果”来定义优先级。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "后果越严重的，优先级越高。", "char_start": 21, "char_end": 34}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "1）不能按照“满足这些需求能获得的收益”来排。", "char_start": 35, "char_end": 58}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "为什么？因为一旦出现这种困难，就意味着你没有把握满足全部的需求，因此实际发生的不会是“满足后获取收益”这个情境，而是“未满足付出代价”这个情境。", "char_start": 59, "char_end": 131}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你要实事求是，不能按根本没发生的情境来算。", "char_start": 132, "char_end": 153}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "2）不能按“我最有能力达到的优先”来算。", "char_start": 154, "char_end": 174}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "因为如果你这样算出来的排序和“最小后果算法”算出来的排序矛盾，你会因为坚持按照前者执行而承受更大的损失。", "char_start": 175, "char_end": 227}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "承受了更大的损失就是客观的失败。", "char_start": 228, "char_end": 244}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "“达成概率”只有折算成潜在损失额后才实际有效，它只能用作计算潜在总损失的一个影响因素，就像完成后的预期收益也只能拿来作为计算总损失的一个影响因素一样。", "char_start": 245, "char_end": 320}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "3）人要对“如果完不成有多大的损失”做不间断的全局管理，优先于“如果完成可以得到多少收益”，这是基本生存的铁法则，绝不允许打破和背弃。", "char_start": 321, "char_end": 388}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "实际上，这个法则直接就把“赌博破产”“误中庞氏骗局”这些普遍的致命风险直接扼杀了。", "char_start": 389, "char_end": 430}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这是扶正祛邪之本。", "char_start": 431, "char_end": 440}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "切记。", "char_start": 441, "char_end": 444}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 13}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0466"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何定义需求的优先级？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013"], "summary": "围绕“优先级算法”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“按照“不满足该需求的后果”来定义优先级。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "按照“不满足该需求的后果”来定义优先级。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "a7401fe2-2130-5568-abbe-5c01c6ebb8ed", "source_ordinal": 822, "reading_ordinal": 3235, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "清除水银", "published_at": "2025-04-26T16:42:13.694000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/372254070/answer/1899502308322154240"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "解决液态水银污染问题，最好的手段是在吸尘器积尘袋中装入足量的硫磺粉，然后用不带毛刷的吸头逐寸的吸遍所有可能被污染的表面。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 60}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "特别注意，要从非污染区边缘向污染区深处地毯式推进，永远确保自己的双脚没有踩到过未经处理的污染区，以防水银微珠沾染到鞋底的复杂结构里。", "char_start": 61, "char_end": 127}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "自然，每一次都要吸净鞋底。", "char_start": 128, "char_end": 141}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "吸集完毕，用仪器测量积尘袋内的汞浓度。", "char_start": 142, "char_end": 161}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "然后换新袋，加硫磺粉，再次操作。", "char_start": 162, "char_end": 178}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "反复换袋、吸集、检测，直到最后一次无法检出，就可以认为彻底解决了。", "char_start": 179, "char_end": 212}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "全部完成之后，打开全部门窗，用风扇大量通风——因为吸尘器的高速气流有可能让水银有所蒸发，把这部分通风排除即可。", "char_start": 213, "char_end": 268}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 7}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0466"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：我把水银温度计打碎了，找不到水银珠，因为是甩的时候碎的，只通风可以吗？挺害怕的。但我找不到水银珠？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007"], "summary": "围绕“清除水银”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“解决液态水银污染问题，最好的手段是在吸尘器积尘袋中装入足量的硫磺粉，然后用不带毛刷的吸头逐寸的吸遍所有可能被污染的表面。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "解决液态水银污染问题，最好的手段是在吸尘器积尘袋中装入足量的硫磺粉，然后用不带毛刷的吸头逐寸的吸遍所有可能被污染的表面。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 60, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "efd0ca9f-216a-5426-91d8-ac4a8e84e0dd", "source_ordinal": 821, "reading_ordinal": 3236, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "传", "published_at": "2025-04-27T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/22f849dc1d5011f0b01d52540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "因为道是行传的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "一种道理，说得头头是道、天花乱坠，说的人不行、听的人不行，毫无意义。", "char_start": 9, "char_end": 43}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "或者换一个角度说——说得天花乱坠、头头是道，其实都是假的。", "char_start": 44, "char_end": 73}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "说到人一跃而起、以剑斫案、断指为誓都仍然是假的。", "char_start": 74, "char_end": 98}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "说到人念念不忘、兢兢业业、鞠躬尽瘁，都仍然是假的。", "char_start": 99, "char_end": 124}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "要念念不忘、兢兢业业、鞠躬尽瘁，而且还薪火相传，才是真的。", "char_start": 125, "char_end": 154}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "只有到祖师一生践行不辍，且弟子薪火相传，再传弟子开枝散叶，这道才算“传”下了。", "char_start": 155, "char_end": 194}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这期间，“言”如风吹止水，“行”才是勒石铭金。", "char_start": 195, "char_end": 218}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "不必“做到”，不必“完美”，但必须要行。", "char_start": 219, "char_end": 239}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "做不到，也要行，", "char_start": 240, "char_end": 248}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "不完美，也要行，", "char_start": 249, "char_end": 257}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "行到何处就是何处，", "char_start": 258, "char_end": 267}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "只要行。", "char_start": 268, "char_end": 272}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你行，你所传的人才能行。", "char_start": 273, "char_end": 285}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "你先行，传人才能行得更好。", "char_start": 286, "char_end": 299}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "教以言述，道以行传。", "char_start": 301, "char_end": 311}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "记住了。", "char_start": 313, "char_end": 317}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 19}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0466"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：“道”不可言传的根本原因是什么？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017"], "summary": "围绕“传”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“因为道是行传的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "因为道是行传的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "b0e736c2-b5c4-5a6c-ad07-8cf7b74afd34", "source_ordinal": 820, "reading_ordinal": 3237, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "好消息的蛋", "published_at": "2025-04-27T19:28:11.658000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1896882364531053698/answer/1899906969797633741"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这么说吧——“抑郁症”实际上是根植于人类智力能力之中的问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 30}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "可以这么说——一种生物无法陷入抑郁，那么这种生物根本无法被称为智慧物种。", "char_start": 31, "char_end": 67}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "既然智慧生物必然能陷入抑郁，那就会出现一个理所当然会让ta们陷入抑郁的正常条件。", "char_start": 68, "char_end": 108}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这就像一种可燃物必然有一个燃点，燃点到了就自然要着火一样，这不叫一种异常，而是一种正常。", "char_start": 109, "char_end": 153}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "一个未经训练的普通人，被几千万人关注，还是有名有姓、露根露底的被关注，还坚持正能量立场，还没有什么商业代言取得相称的收入，这基本是注定要抑郁一下的配置。", "char_start": 154, "char_end": 230}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这就和“中年丧子必然会痛苦很长时间”一样，属于正常人对非常事的正常反应。", "char_start": 231, "char_end": 267}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这根本不构成什么“社会问题”。", "char_start": 268, "char_end": 283}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "社会没法健康到对这样的人不苛责、不“恶意碰瓷”的程度。", "char_start": 284, "char_end": 311}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "必然会有心怀怨毒的失意者，而这些人必然要去针对李永乐这样坚持正能量的头部目标。这种冲击包含的阴毒、狠辣，无论是规模还是程度都是远超普通人基于日常人际相处的想象的。", "char_start": 312, "char_end": 393}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "ta必然要抑郁一轮，这躲不掉。", "char_start": 394, "char_end": 409}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这就是站在这个位置上必须要承受的代价，没什么好说的。", "char_start": 410, "char_end": 436}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "扛不住，激流勇退也没什么不对，让出来的位置也自然有新崛起的角色来承担。", "char_start": 437, "char_end": 472}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "要继续扛下去，那就只有向前击穿这些试炼，接受“事情就是会这样”，学会无视这些声音。", "char_start": 473, "char_end": 514}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "笑骂由君笑骂，将来功过自知。", "char_start": 515, "char_end": 529}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "另一方面，不要把这些污言秽语看作纯损失。", "char_start": 530, "char_end": 550}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "事实上，如果你有把握将来必然出现部分人在事实面前不得不承认自己是错的，来认错道歉，并对现在的恶浪形成逆潮，你反而不妨把现在的“恶浪滔天”看作是一笔潜在的收益。", "char_start": 551, "char_end": 630}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "因为将来无法否认的事实落地时，当初因为受人蛊惑而误解、攻击你的人会大片大片的幡然醒悟，加倍的欢迎你、拥抱你。", "char_start": 631, "char_end": 685}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "反而会比没有这番误会形成的关系更牢固。", "char_start": 686, "char_end": 705}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "你只需要非常谨慎小心的检查自己是不是在基于事实说实在话，不要过度纠结这些话是不是会惹来一些人的情绪反应。", "char_start": 706, "char_end": 758}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "把这视为“更坚固的得人”的一种可行路径，不但不要为此感到苦痛沮丧，反而是要抱着“这可太好了，这意味着事实降临时我可以得到更多的拥抱”的心态，把这看作一种被伪装成诅咒的祝福。", "char_start": 759, "char_end": 845}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "A blessing in disguise.", "char_start": 846, "char_end": 869}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "当你是事实的侍者，对事实有坚强的信心，你就会近乎毫不费力的相信这种反转的必然性。", "char_start": 870, "char_end": 910}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "并且因着这样的信心，不悲反喜，不苦反乐。", "char_start": 911, "char_end": 931}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "具体来说就是这样的——我这都是经得起未来时代检验的大实话，你现在骂得凶，将来它受住了检验，你只会比那些没骂过的人体会更深。", "char_start": 932, "char_end": 993}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "说白了，就是在你爱我之前，必须让你先恨一段。", "char_start": 994, "char_end": 1016}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "我既然知道你将来必然因为这一段的恨而更爱我，那么这一段的恨对我来说就是尚未孵化完成的好消息的蛋。", "char_start": 1017, "char_end": 1065}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "那我沮丧个啥？", "char_start": 1066, "char_end": 1073}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "我的兽性本能暴躁不安，但我的神性灵智根本暗喜好吗？", "char_start": 1074, "char_end": 1099}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "只要我把心里那头野兽关笼子里叫丫老实点，多跟我心里的天使聊天打牌不就齐活了？", "char_start": 1100, "char_end": 1138}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "这才是遇到这些困扰的人穿透这段必然的抑郁所应行的出路。", "char_start": 1139, "char_end": 1166}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "这不是什么社会问题，仅仅是一个个人成长问题罢了。", "char_start": 1167, "char_end": 1191}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "祝李老师早点穿透迷雾——俺们六六天使棋牌社要打季赛，北京队正好三缺一。", "char_start": 1192, "char_end": 1227}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 32}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0466"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：知名网红老师李永乐因爆红后遭受恶意「碰瓷」和苛责陷入抑郁症的困境，这揭示了什么社会问题？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032"], "summary": "围绕“好消息的蛋”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这么说吧——“抑郁症”实际上是根植于人类智力能力之中的问题。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这么说吧——“抑郁症”实际上是根植于人类智力能力之中的问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 30, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "ee2843bc-f828-50fa-9895-96da50fe3a0e", "source_ordinal": 819, "reading_ordinal": 3238, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "当分尽分", "published_at": "2025-04-27T21:48:22.020000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1897644446725683086/answer/1899941061238986259"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "道不同，不相与谋。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 9}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "也不必谈什么对错，总之你现在知道双方的道德观、价值观有重大的冲突；而更重要的是，对方一旦遇到这种冲突，就会毫不犹豫的对你实施语言暴力——这就是明确的分手信号。", "char_start": 10, "char_end": 89}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这是好事。", "char_start": 90, "char_end": 95}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "因为带着这种程度的分歧和这种处理分歧的模式，前面只有灾难。", "char_start": 96, "char_end": 125}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "现在分手，绝对比过几年生了孩子，孩子四岁，你自己已经当了五年家庭主妇却已经实在忍受不下去再离婚要好。", "char_start": 126, "char_end": 176}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "女性对男性的危险倾向必须要高度警惕，毕竟女性是沉没成本和社会风险更大的一方。", "char_start": 177, "char_end": 215}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "宁可错过，不要勉强。", "char_start": 216, "char_end": 226}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "另外再找吧，价值观可以和你匹配的人很多，不必这么留恋。", "char_start": 227, "char_end": 254}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "btw：", "char_start": 256, "char_end": 260}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "千万不要为了避免冲突而回避聊这些敏感话题。", "char_start": 261, "char_end": 282}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "恰恰相反，要多聊，聊透。", "char_start": 283, "char_end": 295}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "聊得不好要分手，那是该分的，是提前避祸。", "char_start": 296, "char_end": 316}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "聊得好，聊得投机，那不是更加甜蜜吗？", "char_start": 317, "char_end": 335}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这明明都是好结果，为什么不要多聊？", "char_start": 336, "char_end": 353}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "小心翼翼回避，回避出一个假的“没有问题”来，就算是一时没有分手，其实你自己心里也清楚这个所谓的“关系良好”是伪装出来的。", "char_start": 354, "char_end": 414}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你到后来是因为青春老去，不得不接受这么个假东西而已——这样的“爱情”，弱不禁风。", "char_start": 415, "char_end": 455}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 17}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0466"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：和男朋友讨论大同订婚强奸案导致分手，恳请大家为我解解惑，谢谢大家了?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016"], "summary": "围绕“当分尽分”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“道不同，不相与谋。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "道不同，不相与谋。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 9, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "ddd3fb8a-9b29-598d-aaf9-4702db333995", "source_ordinal": 818, "reading_ordinal": 3239, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "欠债还钱", "published_at": "2025-04-28T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/8d11236a1e0011f09edf52540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "1）该认的账，要认。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 10}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "确实是合理合法、自己主动去借的，不管现在自己处境如何，该认就必须认。不要因为还不起就耍鸡贼放赖、坚决不认。", "char_start": 11, "char_end": 64}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这是丧良心的事，不会有好下场。", "char_start": 65, "char_end": 80}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "做人要承担自己应分的责任，不要逃避。", "char_start": 81, "char_end": 99}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你认，你这个态度就值钱，你就有得到协商、宽免的资格，你才有牌可打。", "char_start": 100, "char_end": 133}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你不认，那债主只好跟你讲讲拳头、讲肾了。", "char_start": 134, "char_end": 154}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "2）坚持还款。", "char_start": 156, "char_end": 163}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "一个月还100、200也罢，甚至5块、10块也罢，一定要坚持还，要有金额在动。而且是不等人催，主动打款。", "char_start": 164, "char_end": 216}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "哪怕这点钱连利息都还不上，那毕竟也有实质性的还款动作，在证明你有承担责任的自觉。", "char_start": 217, "char_end": 257}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "别的不谈，债主要是嫌你还得慢把你打伤了，那ta每月这一两百的进账都会消失，这个账ta当然会算。", "char_start": 258, "char_end": 305}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "3）坚决保持自己的健康基本生活。", "char_start": 307, "char_end": 323}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "吃饭、睡觉、交通、基本通信、基本医疗、必要的学习费用这些费用不管债主怎么逼迫也不交出去。自己自觉点不要定得太高，不要奢侈，但必须坚决维持自己的基本生活。", "char_start": 324, "char_end": 400}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "在你按第一条在坚持还款的前提下，债主的工作并不那么难做。——你不能维持健康、不能正常工作，ta更不能指望自己的债权兑现。", "char_start": 401, "char_end": 461}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "但如果你搞成连平时一点还款金额都没有，债主当然没法接受。", "char_start": 462, "char_end": 490}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "4）积极劳动，努力进取。", "char_start": 492, "char_end": 504}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "有上面这些条件垫底，你基本生活有保障了，你就有了积极劳动、积极进取的基础。你就踏踏实实的去努力，不要再偷奸耍滑、输打赢要。", "char_start": 505, "char_end": 566}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "一旦你赢得了什么收入增长，那么也不必把全部的增长额都拿来还给债主，你也要给自己留一点点，改善一下自己的生活。", "char_start": 567, "char_end": 621}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "但无论如何，你的收入增加了，债主的回款也必须要有所增加。", "char_start": 622, "char_end": 650}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "否则你不管发展多好对方都没有任何收益，对方给你延期、宽限的价值何在？", "char_start": 651, "char_end": 685}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "而一旦你踏上了上坡路，债主回款提升了、你自己的生活也有所改善，这个事情就在向积极方向走。", "char_start": 686, "char_end": 730}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "士气就会不同。", "char_start": 731, "char_end": 738}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "人的发展是很难讲的，你以为几十万很难还，等你搞到年薪百万的时候，几十万只不过是几个月的收入而已。", "char_start": 739, "char_end": 787}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "实际上是那些“反正搞好了也全是别人的”的消极预期在抑制你的积极性，才导致你用消极的自我评估来估算还债周期，才得出“一辈子都还不完”的结论。", "char_start": 788, "char_end": 857}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "其实这是可以避免的。", "char_start": 858, "char_end": 868}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "5）债主将来可能愿意减免处置。", "char_start": 870, "char_end": 885}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "对于长期坏账、呆账，债主等待时间久了，很容易折价出售，接手的公司天然的成本就低了一大截，很自然就会出现“用减免换提前”的策略。", "char_start": 886, "char_end": 949}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "记得之前你收入提升给自己攒了一小笔份额吧？你要是比较节省，那么等到对方给你提议“提前换减免”时，你跳着够一够、找父母凑一点，就有机会提前谈判解决剩余的欠款。", "char_start": 950, "char_end": 1028}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 31}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0466"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：当欠债金额达到一辈子也还不了的情况，你会怎么办？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027"], "summary": "围绕“欠债还钱”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“1）该认的账，要认。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "1）该认的账，要认。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 10, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
